## Description: Alias of `ddev setup`: install TYPO3 v14.3 and activate nr_repurpose + nr_llm
## Usage: install
## Example: ddev install
#
# `setup` is the canonical one-shot entry point (Netresearch DDEV convention).
# This name stays as an alias for setups and habits that still run
# `ddev install`.
exec "$(dirname "$0")/setup" "$@"
